  \ tired of it. Trying to be helpful and friendly to everyone to make a career and\
  \ prove herself as a medic.\r\nLinda has a fear of touching people and bodily contact.\r\
  \n\r\nDream: to become a famous scientist and discover a cure for some terrible\
  \ disease. Or at least become a successful doctor.\r\n\r\nLikes: her mom and her\
